## HarmonyOS (harmony/ — DevEco project; build/ and *.o already ignored above)
harmony/**/oh_modules/
harmony/.hvigor/
harmony/**/.cxx/
harmony/**/.cache/
harmony/**/.preview/
harmony/local.properties
